  maroon_tokens:
    count: 4-16
    placement: scattered on floor cells, never inside dest block, never on wall
    reachable: 2-15 tokens reachable via 4-connected BFS through floor+maroon from dest openings
    unreachable: 0-10 tokens in walled-off floor regions (distractors)
    reachable_fill_range: 2-9 (min of 9 and reachable count); varies to show partial and full fills
  transformation:
    rule: BFS from passable cells adjacent to dest block through floor+maroon; rank reachable maroon by distance (ties broken by row then col); closest k fill dest in row-major order; moved maroon erased to floor
    conservation: total maroon count preserved (moved, not created/destroyed)
